What is the output of the following Java program?

```java
class A { A() { System.out.print("A"); } }
class B extends A { B() { System.out.print("B"); } }
class C extends B { C() { System.out.print("C"); } }
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new C();
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following Java program?

```java
class P { int x = 10; int get() { return x; } }
class Q extends P { int x = 20; int get() { return x; } }
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        P obj = new Q();
        System.out.println(obj.x + " " + obj.get());
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following Java program?

```java
class Base {
    static String s() { return "Bs"; }
    String m() { return "Bm"; }
    String run() { return s() + m(); }
}
class Derived extends Base {
    static String s() { return "Ds"; }
    String m() { return "Dm" + super.m(); }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Base b = new Derived();
        System.out.println(b.run());
    }
}
```
